### Settings - Upsert GitHub PAT
PUT {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/github-pat
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"pat": "ghp_replace_me"
}

### Settings - Get GitHub PAT status
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/github-pat
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Settings - Delete GitHub PAT
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/github-pat
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Settings - Create API key
POST {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Local IDE Key"
}

### Settings - List API keys
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Settings - Revoke API key
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/api-keys/{{apiKeyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Settings - Get preferences
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Settings - Update preferences
PUT {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"preferred_model": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0"
}

### Settings - Get constitution
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/constitution
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Settings - Set constitution
PUT {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/constitution
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"content": "Always validate security and privacy impacts first."
}

### Settings - Delete constitution
DELETE {{apiRoot}}/api/settings/constitution
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
